<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Business Document Verification</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            color: #333333;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 20px;
            border: 1px solid #dddddd;
            border-radius: 8px;
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 20px;
            color: #222222;
        }
        .highlight {
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #007bff;
        }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 20px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #777777;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Business Documentation Request</h1>
        <p>Dear Admin,</p>
        <p>
            A new document verification request has been submitted by 
            <span class="highlight">{{name}}</span>.
        </p>
        <p>
            <strong>Document Type:</strong> {{documentType}} <br>
            <strong>Business ID:</strong> {{businessId}}
        </p>
        <p>
            Please review the submitted document and take the necessary action.
        </p>
        <p>Best regards,<br>Pinntag System</p>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>This is an automated email. Please do not reply.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
